OpenSSL 3.5.9 (LTS)

Prebuilt static libs from ConanCenter `openssl/3.5.9` (recipe rev
e9977d17028841f6971240542d1f7b11), MSVC 194 / Release / static /
compiler.runtime=dynamic:

- arm64 (armv8): package 081a42677cf02160f44f9051851d2252bb19d85e
  (package rev 6a33738db16cdb5b6391f22de3b7845a)
- x64 (x86_64): package 28abdbfc5f7554635c526cc38d233f2beb62ab28
  (package rev f42d0e22c45c5444df070ea85608034b)

Version policy: OpenSSL 3.5 is the current LTS release (supported until
2030-04-08). OpenSSL 3.6 is NOT an LTS release (support ends 2026-11-01)
and must not be used.

x86 (ia32) is NOT included: ConanCenter ships no ia32 prebuilt for
3.5.9; building for x86 requires compiling OpenSSL 3.5.9 from source.

Headers: identical across archs except `configuration.h` (per-arch);
the vendored tree uses a dispatcher (configuration.h) selecting
configuration_windows-arm64.h / configuration_windows-x86_64.h.

Mars uses only rand.h / md5.h / crypto.h (RAND_bytes, MD5), which are
stable across 3.x; the build is verified end-to-end (dart test).
